  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fVE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/VanillaEXOrcz/bh_promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"282\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/VanillaEXOrcz/bh_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R4VJwrUaCx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/VanillaEXOrcz/bh_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/VanillaEXOrcz/bh_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>模組亮點<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MWzIUlLPAY8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vv8n9TzovJg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/la8blWL4DHI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/VanillaEXOrcz/bh_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/960008722732679218/961782876351913984/Vanilla_extended_goblin_2.png\"><br><br>帶著好奇與敬畏，探索充滿全新獸人的 Minecraft 世界！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前正持續新增多種獸人與哥布林種類，它們會自然生成於世界各地，正尋找著&nbsp;<em>你</em>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>怪物資訊</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QzPjX_Lo6SEp6VHCKnKJM3RyuiBabjCu1f2F23ilgPQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QzPjX_Lo6SEp6VHCKnKJM3RyuiBabjCu1f2F23ilgPQ/edit?usp=sharing</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>為獸人與哥布林打造了複雜的自訂 AI！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>探索獸人營地以獲取戰利品並樂在其中！（包含沙漠變體與雪地變體！）（可於 orcz 設定檔中關閉）</p>\n<p><br>為了生存而與獸人及哥布林展開決戰，更多內容即將登場！<br><br>你可以在 Discord 上透過以下帳號聯繫我們：<br><span>Duke2die4</span><span>#6300</span><br>Kleiders#9777</p>\n<p>legs and arms#8223<br>或加入我們的 Discord 伺服器以獲取最新資訊：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R4VJwrUaCx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/R4VJwrUaCx</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884066029371472/2022-03-08_16.29.40.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884067610619974/2022-03-08_16.32.14.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884071855235132/2022-03-08_16.29.19.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884073289691216/2022-03-08_16.26.58.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884073780428801/2022-03-08_16.27.13.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884075630116884/2022-03-08_16.28.52.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/949082136290418689/950884072819949628/2022-03-08_16.26.24.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br><br>特別感謝<br></strong></p>\n<h6><strong><span><span>Boomyakalolo 負責重新製作物品貼圖。<br><span>Daddy_P1G 提供概念設計與建築規劃</span><br></span></span></strong></h6>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>",
